0 35 568 [
[(This and the following patches show how to use filters in Pd, starting with)]
[(the simplest one: the one-pole low-pass filter. Here we test it with an)]
[(input of white noise. The [lop~] object does the filtering. Its left inlet)]
[(takes an audio signal to be filtered, and its right inlet takes messages or)]
[(signals to set its cutoff frequency in Hertz.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
136 616 moveto 5 0 rlineto 0 -25 rlineto -5 0 rlineto closepath
0.875 0.875 0.875 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
fill
