/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 35 489 [
[(The [lop~] object is normalized to pass DC \050the lowest frequency\051 with a)]
[(gain of one. Higher frequencies are progressively more and more attenuated.)]
[(The lower the cutoff frequency, the lower the total power of the filtered)]
[(noise. If you graph the output you'll see that the waveform gets smoother)]
[(\050and smaller overall\051 as the cutoff frequency is lowered.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
